#
# Upstream:  https://github.com/seedds/nxnative, the dm/gfx/nvn hunks of 736a2ecb ("chain/gmem: shorten raw load pool checks (PR #1833)", co-author MartinBouteruche),
#            b989137a ("chain/vertex: compile shader variants together (PR #2951)", co-author Eric Liu), 2e6f6fd0 ("chain/vertex: lower draw-uniform viewport masks (PR #3074)",
#            co-authors Eliran Zach, PikaMan80), acbb26c3 ("chain/meshstage: spill task payloads past Metal's 16 KB through a device buffer (PR #2264)", co-author FifteenPen);
#            authors seedds, 2026-11-19..23.
# Licence:   MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 seedds (nxnative LICENSE); ported from seedds/nxnative, MIT. The attribution above is kept as the licence asks.
#
# WHAT IT CHANGES (dm/gfx/nvn/nvn_mtl.m, nvn_geometry.inc), each what the 0536 libraries need from the host:
#   - bind_args: each gmem map entry also holds its byte span when the range fits one 4 GiB window (the translator's raw loads check their last entry with it, 736a2ecb);
#   - side_entry: a vertex shader's entry points in its pulling / shadow-input libraries by the names the reflection gives (main0_p / main0_zp / main0_v / main0_zv when the
#     three libraries are cut from one unit), in shader_load, pull_load, vin_fn and the prebuild's pre_desc (b989137a);
#   - the reflection's viewport_mask: such a vertex shader never takes the lean passthrough geometry path (2e6f6fd0);
#   - a task shader's payload past 16 KB: Metal's payload carries a slice offset, the payload goes through a buffer at DMSH_MESH_SPILL_SLOT sized to the draw's workgroups
#     (indirect draws drained to read their count), three new red lines (keys 190-192; g_red_once raised to 193) (acbb26c3).
# Adapted: the hunks re-made on this tree (NX2Apple + engine-patches 0401..0535); RED_ONCE keys renumbered (upstream 175-177 are taken here).
# Not taken: ae5d8f51's host part (nvn_live.inc, hle_glslc.c: the Mac recovering shaders compiled during play; the app has its own live translation).
# Games: every game (all libraries change); Ocarina of Time (raw loads, mesh), Nintendo Switch Sports Resort (task payloads > 16 KB), Mario Tennis Aces (viewport masks). Switches: none.
# Tests (M1 Pro): scripts/build-host.sh device + simulator with HOST_TESTS=1. NOT run on a device.
# Apply with: patch -p1, to the tree out-stage/out-engine/engine + engine-patches/0401..0536, in the order of the numbers of this folder (scripts/build-host.sh does).

